🛠️ Technologies Used

This project is built using basic web development technologies.

---Frontend Technologies

* HTML – Structure of the application
* CSS – Styling and layout design
* JavaScript – Dynamic functionality and logic

Programming Concepts Used

* DOM Manipulation
* Event Handling
* Array-based Data Storage
* Dynamic UI Updates
* Real-Time Calculations

These concepts make the project a good practice exercise for beginner developers learning JavaScript.

